{"id":"0d71e87a2f416230","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-function.md","title":"Function and Finite Sequence","display":"df-function — Function and Finite Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-function","aliases":["89-df-function"],"display":"df-function — Function and Finite Sequence","depends_on":["[[89-df-omega]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function — Function and Finite Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ad117274f74965a\" href=\"?note=7ad117274f74965a\" title=\"89-df-omega\">89-df-omega</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,f\">\\(A,B,f\\)</span> 为集合；有序对取 Kuratowski 编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 为最小归纳集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> 同时表示有限序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 为下述有限序列。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>关系合成中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\">\\(R,S\\)</span> 为集合关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为集合；更新中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 为集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{nth},\\mathsf{last}\">\\(\\mathsf{nth},\\mathsf{last}\\)</span> 是仅用于自然数序列码的总访问函数，不改变普通 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i\">\\(s_i\\)</span> 的有效索引域。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle x,y\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\{x\\},\\{x,y\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\mid\\exists y\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\coloneqq\\{y\\mid\\exists x\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Function}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall z\\in f\\ \\exists x,y\\ z=\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\ \\land\\\\\n\\forall x,y,z\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in f)\\to y=z),\\\\\nf:A\\to B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{Function}(f)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq B,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Function}(f)\\land\n\\forall x,x&#39;,y\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x&#39;,y\\rangle\\in f)\\to x=x&#39;),\\\\\nf:A\\twoheadrightarrow B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow (f:A\\to B)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=B,\\\\\nf:A\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(f:A\\twoheadrightarrow B)\\land\\operatorname{Inj}(f),\\\\\nB^A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f\\subseteq A\\times B\\mid f:A\\to B\\},\\quad\nB^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}B^n,\\\\\n|s|&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\quad\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\ns\\mathbin{\\frown}t&amp;\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{\\langle |s|+i,t(i)\\rangle\\mid i&lt;|t|\\},\\\\\ns\\upharpoonright k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,s(i)\\rangle\\mid i&lt;\\min(k,|s|)\\},\\\\\n\\pi(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b\\quad(a,b\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s)\\coloneqq1+\\pi(a,\\mathsf{seq}(s)),\\\\\n\\pi_0(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{a\\le n\\mid\\exists b\\le n\\ \\pi(a,b)=n\\},\\quad\n\\pi_1(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{b\\le n\\mid\\pi(\\pi_0(n),b)=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{unseq}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{unseq}(n+1)\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_0(n)\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathsf{unseq}(\\pi_1(n)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\mathsf{seq}(\\mathsf{unseq}(n))=n,\\quad\n\\forall s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathsf{unseq}(\\mathsf{seq}(s))=s,\\\\\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\mid s\\in B^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\\\\\nf(x)=y&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Function}(f),\\ x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)),\\\\\nA\\times B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\mid a\\in A,\\ b\\in B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle x,y\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\{x\\},\\{x,y\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\mid\\exists y\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\coloneqq\\{y\\mid\\exists x\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Function}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall z\\in f\\ \\exists x,y\\ z=\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\ \\land\\\\\n\\forall x,y,z\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in f)\\to y=z),\\\\\nf:A\\to B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{Function}(f)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq B,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Function}(f)\\land\n\\forall x,x&#39;,y\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x&#39;,y\\rangle\\in f)\\to x=x&#39;),\\\\\nf:A\\twoheadrightarrow B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow (f:A\\to B)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=B,\\\\\nf:A\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(f:A\\twoheadrightarrow B)\\land\\operatorname{Inj}(f),\\\\\nB^A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f\\subseteq A\\times B\\mid f:A\\to B\\},\\quad\nB^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}B^n,\\\\\n|s|&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\quad\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\ns\\mathbin{\\frown}t&amp;\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{\\langle |s|+i,t(i)\\rangle\\mid i&lt;|t|\\},\\\\\ns\\upharpoonright k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,s(i)\\rangle\\mid i&lt;\\min(k,|s|)\\},\\\\\n\\pi(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b\\quad(a,b\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s)\\coloneqq1+\\pi(a,\\mathsf{seq}(s)),\\\\\n\\pi_0(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{a\\le n\\mid\\exists b\\le n\\ \\pi(a,b)=n\\},\\quad\n\\pi_1(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{b\\le n\\mid\\pi(\\pi_0(n),b)=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{unseq}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{unseq}(n+1)\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_0(n)\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathsf{unseq}(\\pi_1(n)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\mathsf{seq}(\\mathsf{unseq}(n))=n,\\quad\n\\forall s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathsf{unseq}(\\mathsf{seq}(s))=s,\\\\\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\mid s\\in B^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\\\\\nf(x)=y&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Function}(f),\\ x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)),\\\\\nA\\times B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\mid a\\in A,\\ b\\in B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR\\circ S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,z\\rangle\\mid\\exists y\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in S)\\},\\\\\nf[X]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{y\\mid\\exists x\\in X\\ \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\},\\\\\nf[x\\mapsto y]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in f\\mid a\\ne x\\}\\cup\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\},\\\\\ns_i&amp;\\coloneqq s(i)\\quad(i&lt;|s|),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IncEnum}(E,s)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nE\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\omega)\\land s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)=E\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|s|\\ s_i&lt;s_j,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\omega)\\ \\exists!s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{IncEnum}(E,s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{inc}(E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{IncEnum}(E,s)\n\\quad(E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\omega)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{nth}(n,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf{unseq}(n)_i,&amp;i&lt;|\\mathsf{unseq}(n)|,\\\\0,&amp;i\\ge|\\mathsf{unseq}(n)|,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(n,i\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{len}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq|\\mathsf{unseq}(n)|,\\\\\n\\mathsf{last}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf{nth}(n,\\mathsf{len}(n)-1),&amp;\\mathsf{len}(n)&gt;0,\\\\0,&amp;\\mathsf{len}(n)=0.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR\\circ S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,z\\rangle\\mid\\exists y\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in S)\\},\\\\\nf[X]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{y\\mid\\exists x\\in X\\ \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\},\\\\\nf[x\\mapsto y]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in f\\mid a\\ne x\\}\\cup\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\},\\\\\ns_i&amp;\\coloneqq s(i)\\quad(i&lt;|s|),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IncEnum}(E,s)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nE\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\omega)\\land s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)=E\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|s|\\ s_i&lt;s_j,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\omega)\\ \\exists!s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{IncEnum}(E,s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{inc}(E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{IncEnum}(E,s)\n\\quad(E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\omega)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{nth}(n,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf{unseq}(n)_i,&amp;i&lt;|\\mathsf{unseq}(n)|,\\\\0,&amp;i\\ge|\\mathsf{unseq}(n)|,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(n,i\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{len}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq|\\mathsf{unseq}(n)|,\\\\\n\\mathsf{last}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf{nth}(n,\\mathsf{len}(n)-1),&amp;\\mathsf{len}(n)&gt;0,\\\\0,&amp;\\mathsf{len}(n)=0.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐本书实际使用但原压缩包未提供的基础接口；不恢复或冒充其他书籍的原文件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"7ad117274f74965a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-omega]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,f","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"R,S","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{nth},\\mathsf{last}","display":false},{"tex":"s_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle x,y\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\{\\{x\\},\\{x,y\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(f)&\\coloneqq\\{x\\mid\\exists y\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\coloneqq\\{y\\mid\\exists x\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Function}(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall z\\in f\\ \\exists x,y\\ z=\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\ \\land\\\\\n\\forall x,y,z\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in f)\\to y=z),\\\\\nf:A\\to B&\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{Function}(f)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq B,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Function}(f)\\land\n\\forall x,x',y\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x',y\\rangle\\in f)\\to x=x'),\\\\\nf:A\\twoheadrightarrow B&\\Longleftrightarrow (f:A\\to B)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=B,\\\\\nf:A\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}B&\\Longleftrightarrow(f:A\\twoheadrightarrow B)\\land\\operatorname{Inj}(f),\\\\\nB^A&\\coloneqq\\{f\\subseteq A\\times B\\mid f:A\\to B\\},\\quad\nB^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}B^n,\\\\\n|s|&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\quad\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\ns\\mathbin{\\frown}t&\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{\\langle |s|+i,t(i)\\rangle\\mid i<|t|\\},\\\\\ns\\upharpoonright k&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,s(i)\\rangle\\mid i<\\min(k,|s|)\\},\\\\\n\\pi(a,b)&\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b\\quad(a,b\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s)\\coloneqq1+\\pi(a,\\mathsf{seq}(s)),\\\\\n\\pi_0(n)&\\coloneqq\\min\\{a\\le n\\mid\\exists b\\le n\\ \\pi(a,b)=n\\},\\quad\n\\pi_1(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{b\\le n\\mid\\pi(\\pi_0(n),b)=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{unseq}(0)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{unseq}(n+1)\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_0(n)\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathsf{unseq}(\\pi_1(n)),\\\\\n&\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\mathsf{seq}(\\mathsf{unseq}(n))=n,\\quad\n\\forall s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}\\ \\mathsf{unseq}(\\mathsf{seq}(s))=s,\\\\\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(B)&\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\mid s\\in B^{<\\omega}\\},\\\\\nf(x)=y&\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Function}(f),\\ x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)),\\\\\nA\\times B&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\mid a\\in A,\\ b\\in B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR\\circ S&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,z\\rangle\\mid\\exists y\\ (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in S)\\},\\\\\nf[X]&\\coloneqq\\{y\\mid\\exists x\\in X\\ \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\},\\\\\nf[x\\mapsto y]&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in f\\mid a\\ne x\\}\\cup\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\},\\\\\ns_i&\\coloneqq s(i)\\quad(i<|s|),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IncEnum}(E,s)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nE\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\omega)\\land s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)=E\\land\\forall i<j<|s|\\ s_i<s_j,\\\\\n&\\forall E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\omega)\\ \\exists!s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{IncEnum}(E,s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{inc}(E)&\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{IncEnum}(E,s)\n\\quad(E\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\omega)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{nth}(n,i)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf{unseq}(n)_i,&i<|\\mathsf{unseq}(n)|,\\\\0,&i\\ge|\\mathsf{unseq}(n)|,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(n,i\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{len}(n)&\\coloneqq|\\mathsf{unseq}(n)|,\\\\\n\\mathsf{last}(n)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf{nth}(n,\\mathsf{len}(n)-1),&\\mathsf{len}(n)>0,\\\\0,&\\mathsf{len}(n)=0.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4124,"backlinks":[{"id":"d0116d2c9f5af20f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3997bfb78544d69c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"输入 $\\vec x\\in\\omega^k$ 放在编号 $0,\\ldots,k-1$ 的寄存器；输出为寄存器 $0$。配置为 $(j,r)$，$r:\\omega\\to\\omega$ 有有限非零支集。有限运行证书使用下述固定长度寄存器向量编码；$\\mathsf{seq},\\mathsf{unseq}$ 取 [[89-df-function]]。"},{"id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"980052349c9e74e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4505fdbef0375a48","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d04b869450b424f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b1c35d55817857e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_o